## Question

Which forms does a real local tracker use for a ticket's and a map's state, and how common is each? Survey every Markdown file of a private five-month production tracker (49 effort directories, 342 files):

- every header line before the first H2, and every other line that states or changes a state;
- the headings, and where a closed ticket's resolution sits;
- what a careful reader concludes about each file's state, and whether the effort's map records it.

Record shapes and counts only: nothing of the tracker's text may leave the machine. Compare what is found with what the scout reads today and with upstream's conventions in [#10](https://github.com/dbarjs/hero-synergy/issues/10).

