## Question

Write one small invented fixture for every form in the findings of [State forms on a real local tracker](https://github.com/dbarjs/hero-synergy/issues/131), each with its careful reading:

- the Status line shapes and their annotations, and the claim forms;
- the type forms, the blocker forms with their none markers and state notes, and the membership lines;
- the resolution placements, the map file names and the map Status lines;
- the traps: a Status line quoted in code, `## ` inside a fence, two `## Comments` headings, one line holding two states.

The text is invented, never taken from the corpus; when the corpus is on the machine, run the leak check against `/tmp/example-scratches` before pushing. Lay the fixtures out so one table test can feed each to the readers. Forms whose reading [The truth for the files a careful reader can't call](https://github.com/dbarjs/hero-synergy/issues/134) has not settled stay marked unsettled until it closes.

